pass. Both new browser cases pass (31.2s): held real upload read, immediate
sidebar exit/DS framing, animated LCD, actual DeSmuME homebrew handoff, invalid
replacement retention, reduced motion and cancelled startup. Strengthened
native-pixel restoration assertion passes on a separate positive run (29.9s).
The three existing DS backup, GBA-isolation and checkpoint-reload cases pass
together (1.1m). A rendered 960x720 loading screenshot was inspected; this is
technical/visual inspection, not owner approval.
Issue/Project synchronization initially verified the open/In progress mapping.
Completion synchronization runs before the authorized commit.
Publication is pending, independently of local completion; the actual exact-SHA
